1
00:00:00,668 --> 00:00:04,378
(Leonard:)- No problem.
- I had no idea it was so heavy.

2
00:00:05,131 --> 00:00:07,631
(Leonard:)Thing just fell right over on me,
didn't it? Heh.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,550
(David:)Yeah. Lucky for you it wasn't moving.

4
00:00:11,387 --> 00:00:13,557
- Oh, hey, Leonard. Ooh, are you okay?
- Oh, yeah.

5
00:00:13,723 --> 00:00:16,053
(Leonard:)It's just a little motorcycle accident.

6
00:00:16,225 --> 00:00:17,895
Oh, my God. How fast were you going?

7
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:20,850
I don't know. It was all such a blur.

8
00:00:21,022 --> 00:00:22,062
[CHUCKLES]

9
00:00:22,231 --> 00:00:24,061
(David:)Good one.
He couldn't even get it started.

10
00:00:25,067 --> 00:00:28,737
(David:)- Hi. Dave.
- Hi. Penny. So it's your motorcycle?

11
00:00:28,905 --> 00:00:31,495
- Uh-huh.
- Oh. Is it okay?

12
00:00:32,492 --> 00:00:35,412
(Leonard:)Lucky for the bike it landed on my leg.

13
00:00:36,245 --> 00:00:38,915
- Mind giving me a hand with Speed Racer?
- Oh, yeah. Sure.

14
00:00:39,081 --> 00:00:41,421
(Penny:)So, um, Dave,
how do you know Leonard?

15
00:00:41,584 --> 00:00:45,084
- I'm a physicist.
- Ha, ha. No, you're not.

16
00:00:46,255 --> 00:00:47,965
DAVID:
Why is that so surprising?

17
00:00:48,132 --> 00:00:53,432
PENNY: Well, it's just that the physicists
I know are indoors-y and pale.

18
00:00:54,263 --> 00:00:55,343
LEONARD:
I'm not indoors-y.

19
00:00:55,515 --> 00:00:59,515
(Leonard:)I just wear the appropriate sun block
because I don't take melanoma lightly.

